{"id":"1689492fab8da0e1","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md","title":"Class Measure Ultrapower and Diagonal Embedding","display":"df-class-measure-ultrapower — Class Measure Ultrapower and Diagonal Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-measure-ultrapower","aliases":["58-df-class-measure-ultrapower"],"display":"df-class-measure-ultrapower — Class Measure Ultrapower and Diagonal Embedding","depends_on":["[[58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-measure-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-measure-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-measure-ultrapower — Class Measure Ultrapower and Diagonal Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b1721f50aceb744e\" href=\"?note=b1721f50aceb744e\" title=\"58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md\">58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,N,j,\\pi\">\\(A,N,j,\\pi\\)</span> 为元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,I,f,g,x\\in V\">\\(U,I,f,g,x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_U=\\bigcup U\">\\(I_U=\\bigcup U\\)</span>。类成员结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\in)\">\\((A,\\in)\\)</span> 不是集合有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{A,U}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{A,U}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_{A,U}\">\\(=_{A,U}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in_{A,U}\">\\(\\in_{A,U}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_x^U\">\\(c_x^U\\)</span> 按下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}\\)</span> 使用实际的有限公式递归满意关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}((A,\\in),U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}((A,\\in),U)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{(A,\\in),U}\">\\(j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{(A,\\in),U}\\)</span> 是最后两式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\\)</span> 上给出的偏元语言算子。结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{(A,\\in)}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_{(A,\\in)}\\)</span> 缩写载体上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:(A,\\in)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N,\\in)\">\\(j:(A,\\in)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N,\\in)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,N)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunction}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b1721f50aceb744e\" href=\"?note=b1721f50aceb744e\" title=\"58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md\">58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sc}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{class}\">\\(\\mathrm{class}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\varphi,\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\varphi,\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{A,U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in A:\\mathrm{Function}(f,I_U,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq A\\},\\\\\nf=_{A,U}g&amp;\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathcal D_{A,U}\\land\\{i\\in I_U:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U,\\\\\nf\\in_{A,U}g&amp;\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathcal D_{A,U}\\land\\{i\\in I_U:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U,\\\\\nc_x^U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I_U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{A,U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in A:\\mathrm{Function}(f,I_U,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq A\\},\\\\\nf=_{A,U}g&amp;\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathcal D_{A,U}\\land\\{i\\in I_U:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U,\\\\\nf\\in_{A,U}g&amp;\\leftrightarrow f,g\\in\\mathcal D_{A,U}\\land\\{i\\in I_U:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U,\\\\\nc_x^U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I_U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}(A)\\land U\\in A\\land\\varnothing\\notin U\n\\land I_U\\in U\\land U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X\\in A\\cap\\mathcal P(I_U)\\;(X\\in U\\lor I_U\\setminus X\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X,Y\\in U\\;(X\\cap Y\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X\\in U\\;\\forall Y\\in A\\cap\\mathcal P(I_U)\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to Y\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,\\mathcal D_{A,U},=_{A,U},\\in_{A,U})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(j(x)=\\pi([c_x^U]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{A,U},=_{A,U}}))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClassZFC}_{58}(A)\\land U\\in A\\land\\varnothing\\notin U\n\\land I_U\\in U\\land U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X\\in A\\cap\\mathcal P(I_U)\\;(X\\in U\\lor I_U\\setminus X\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X,Y\\in U\\;(X\\cap Y\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall X\\in U\\;\\forall Y\\in A\\cap\\mathcal P(I_U)\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to Y\\in U)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassQuotientCollapse}_{58}(\\pi,N,\\mathcal D_{A,U},=_{A,U},\\in_{A,U})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ClassFunction}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,A,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(j(x)=\\pi([c_x^U]^{\\mathrm{Sc}}_{\\mathcal D_{A,U},=_{A,U}}))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}N,j\\;\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}N,j\\;\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\\to\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}((A,\\in),U)=(N,\\in)\n\\land j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{(A,\\in),U}=j\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltDomain}_{58}(A,U)\\to\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}((A,\\in),U)=(N,\\in)\n\\land j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{(A,\\in),U}=j\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassMeasureUltrapower}_{58}(N,j,A,U)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代表函数取自当前模型本身，因而后续迭代的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(U)\">\\(j(U)\\)</span> 只需测量该模型内部的子集。没有将内部测度误当成环境宇宙所有子集上的超滤子，也没有把类模型放入集合函数的值域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md","status":"resolved","id":"b1721f50aceb744e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-quotient-collapse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":